🐛 Describe the bug
Extending pytorch with tensor-like classes isn't supported by Dynamo. Additionally, the error message is not very informative for users who don't know much about dynamo.
(I guess this is known and on someone's roadmap, I'm opening an issue to keep track of this for tensordict integration)
To reproduce:
# Copyright (c) Meta Platforms, Inc. and affiliates.
